What is the total volume of Canadian products, in quantity and in dollar value, exported to ECA countries and paid for by ECA funds:
1.	By countries.
2.	By principal categories of goods: (a) agricultural: (i) field products; (ii) fruit; (iii) vegetables; (iv) meat products; (v) dairy; (b) fish; (c>
lumber;

Orders for Returns
(d)	manufactured goods: (i) heavy industrial machinery, i.e., locomotives, factory, mill, mining and marine equipment, etc.; (ii) agricultural machinery;
(e)	military machinery, equipment and supplies;
(f)	consumer goods other than foods?
3.	Relating to the items, separately, in the above question 2, what is the volume, in quantity and in dollar value, of the offshore purchases of Canadian goods by the U.S.A.?
